{"Mux":{},"Graph":{},"Workspace":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn","ObservationCache":{"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cgraph/dot.go":{"id":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cgraph/dot.go","behavior":"- Provides DOT serialization for a generic Graph[K,T] writing to an io.Writer.\n- Chooses 'strict graph' with '--' for undirected and 'strict digraph' with '-\u003e' for directed graphs based on traits.\n- Retrieves the adjacency map and emits each vertex line with its attribute map and weight=0.\n- For each edge, emits a line with source, edge operator, target, edge weight, and edge attributes.\n- formatAttrs renders vertex attributes as quoted key=value pairs separated by commas (with trailing comma/space).\n- formatEdgeAttrs renders edge attributes as a leading-comma list of quoted key=value pairs suitable for appending after weight."},"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cgraph/graph.go":{"id":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cgraph/graph.go","behavior":"- Wraps dominikbraun/graph.Graph[K,T] with a per-vertex attribute map guarded by an RWMutex.\n- New constructs the wrapper with a hash function and optional trait options.\n- AddVertex merges caller-provided attributes into the local attrs map and forwards to the underlying graph, treating ErrVertexAlreadyExists as a no-op success.\n- SetEdgeAttribute updates an edge attribute via UpdateEdge with EdgeAttribute option.\n- SetVertexAttribute sets a single attribute on a vertex under write lock.\n- VertexWithProperties delegates to the underlying graph and merges the wrapper's stored attributes into the returned properties.\n- vertexAttrs returns a copy of the stored attributes for a vertex under read lock, used by DOT serialization."},"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go":{"id":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go","behavior":"- Defines COG struct holding a concurrent graph of COGNode vertices keyed by hash, with a workspace path and observation cache.\n- COGNode interface requires GetHash, GetSource, and ListImports for polymorphic graph nodes.\n- NewCOG constructs an empty COG with mutex, loaded-files map, observation cache, and a graph using NodeHasher.\n- FilePath returns the persisted COG file path as workspace/captn.cog.\n- OpenCOG opens (or creates) the COG file, returning an empty COG if file is missing, otherwise unmarshalling JSON into it.\n- Persist serializes the COG to JSON and writes it to the COG file path.\n- LoadFile caches parsed files in a thread-safe map and adds them as vertices with an import_type attribute classified via the file's Language.\n- queryWithDepth performs a concurrent depth-bounded traversal: for COGFile nodes it adds the vertex, lists imports, loads each external import file in parallel, skips stdlib/dependency imports, adds edges, and recurses with depth-1; aggregates errors under mutex.\n- QueryWithDepth wraps queryWithDepth, returning a new cgraph-based ObservationGraph.\n- ExplainWithDepth builds the depth-bounded graph and then calls ObservationProvider.ResolveObservationsToGraph, currently returning an empty string regardless of success."},"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/filepos.go":{"id":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/filepos.go","behavior":"- FilePosition models a (Source, line, column, byte offset) location and stringifies as 1-based line:column.\n- NewFilePosition constructs a FilePosition; NewFileRangeAutoBytePosition computes byte positions from line/column via Source and builds a FileRange.\n- Before/After/InsideRange compare FilePositions by BytePosition; CompareFilePosition returns -1/0/1 ordering.\n- FileRange holds Source plus Start/End FilePositions; GetBytes slices the source buffer between them.\n- FileRange Before/After compare by start byte; Contains checks a position falls within [Start, End); ContainedBy checks full containment in another range.\n- CompareFileRange orders two ranges; GetByteRange returns [start,end] byte tuple; String formats as path:start-end."},"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/imports.go":{"id":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/imports.go","behavior":"- Declares ImportType string enum with constants ImportLocal, ImportDependency, ImportStandardLibrary.\n- ResolvedImport pairs an ImportType with Internal (source-side) and External (target-side) FileRange pointers.\n- NewResolvedImport constructs a ResolvedImport from type and two ranges.\n- ResolvedImports is a slice type with GroupByPackage method that buckets imports by their Internal FileRange pointer into a map."},"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/indexed_slice.go":{"id":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/indexed_slice.go","behavior":"- IndexedSlice combines a slice with an ID-\u003eindex map, using an indexer function to derive IDs from values.\n- MarshalJSON/MarshalYAML serialize only the underlying slice.\n- Append adds a value, records its index in the map, and returns the new index.\n- Keys returns all indexed IDs; GetIndex returns the index for an ID; Len returns slice length.\n- Get retrieves a value by ID, returning zero/false when missing or index is out of range.\n- NewIndexedSlice constructs an empty IndexedSlice bound to the provided indexer."},"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/observation.go":{"id":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/observation.go","behavior":"- ObservationSchema defines a JSON-tagged ID and Behavior (min length 40, reasoning bullet-points) used for code observations.\n- GetSchema reflects ObservationSchema into a jsonschema.Schema; Serialize marshals that schema to a JSON string.\n- BatchObservationSchema groups Observations and ConnectionObservations slices, with schema descriptions requiring IDs to match inputs and connection IDs to be edge+link composites.\n- BatchObservationSchema also exposes GetSchema and Serialize via pointer receiver.\n- Asserts at compile time that *ObservationSchema satisfies ObservationSchemaType."},"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/source.go":{"id":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/source.go","behavior":"- Source represents a workspace file with Path and Buffer (Buffer excluded from JSON).\n- BytePositionForLineColumn iterates the buffer to find the start of the requested line, then validates column against the line length (accounting for \\r before \\n) and returns the absolute byte offset.\n- Returns errors for nil source, negative line/column, out-of-range column, or out-of-range line.\n- NewSourceFromFile reads a file from disk under a runtime/trace task 'loadFile' and returns a populated Source."},"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/utils.go":{"id":"/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/utils.go","behavior":"- Generic Map function transforms a slice of T into a slice of R by applying fn to each element, preserving order and length."},"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cgraph/dot.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go":{"id":"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cgraph/dot.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go","behavior":"- DOT serialization consumes the cgraph.Graph that cog builds, rendering vertices with the 'import_type' attributes set by cog.LoadFile and queryWithDepth.\n- Provides the visualization path for graphs produced by COG.QueryWithDepth/ExplainWithDepth."},"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cgraph/graph.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go":{"id":"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cgraph/graph.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go","behavior":"- cgraph.Graph is the concrete graph type instantiated by cog (via cgraph.New(NodeHasher)) inside QueryWithDepth and ExplainWithDepth to build observation graphs.\n- cog.LoadFile and queryWithDepth call AddVertex with VertexAttribute('import_type', ...) which cgraph stores in its attribute map for later DOT export."},"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/indexed_slice.go":{"id":"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/indexed_slice.go","behavior":"- cog (parent) relies on common's IndexedSlice as a shared utility for ID-indexed collections; graph.go itself does not directly instantiate IndexedSlice but the cog package depends on common which provides it."},"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/filepos.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go":{"id":"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/filepos.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go","behavior":"- FileRange (from filepos.go) backs the External range used in cog.queryWithDepth when it dereferences imp.External.Source.Path to load imported files.\n- The path resolution that drives COG graph expansion depends on the FilePosition/FileRange/Source linkage defined here."},"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/imports.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go":{"id":"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/imports.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go","behavior":"- ResolvedImports returned by COGNode.ListImports is iterated by cog.queryWithDepth to fan out to imported files.\n- ImportType constants ImportStandardLibrary and ImportDependency are used to filter out non-local imports from the COG traversal."},"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/observation.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go":{"id":"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/observation.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go","behavior":"- common.ObservationSchema is the value type stored in COG.ObservationCache, providing the per-node behavior payload that ExplainWithDepth's ObservationProvider populates."},"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/source.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go":{"id":"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/source.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go","behavior":"- common.Source underlies the FileRange/External references that cog.queryWithDepth dereferences as imp.External.Source.Path to locate and load imported files via cog.LoadFile."},"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/utils.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go":{"id":"edge:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/common/utils.go:/Users/workspace/Workspace/captn/pkg/cog/graph.go","behavior":"- common.Map is a generic helper available to cog; no direct call is visible in graph.go but it is part of the common utilities the cog package imports for slice transformations."}}}